<title>DUBAI: Saudi Arabia's Q3 M3 shrinks 0.5 pct qtr on qtr.</title>
<headline>Saudi Arabia's Q3 M3 shrinks 0.5 pct qtr on qtr.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's broadly defined M3 money supply shrank 0.5 percent in the third quarter of 1996 over the previous quarter, Saudi Arabian Monetary Agency (SAMA) figures show.</p>
<p>Annual average M3 in 1995 grew 3.5 percent after shrinking 1.5 percent in 1994.</p>
<p>Detailed data (Percentage changes over three months)</p>
<p>			 Q3 1996		   Q2 1996 M3</p>
<p>			 -0.5			+2.6 M2</p>
<p>			 -0.6			+3.6 M1</p>
<p>			 -3.0			+4.3</p>
<p>Monetary aggregates (riyal millions)</p>
<p>		     Q3 1996		   Q2 1996 M3</p>
<p>		     248,329.0		 249,559.7 M2</p>
<p>		     194,019.8		 195,137.9 M1</p>
<p>		     129,078.9		 133,019.5</p>
